OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncils deciding to publish
OL,4,Ahousing lists could 'increase danger
OL,5,Afor migrants' - campaigner
OL,6,
OL,7,FLisburn and Castlereagh Council and
OL,8,FArds and North Down Borough Council
OL,9,Fhave voted to publish details of HMOs
OL,10,Fin those council areas. A number of
OL,11,Fother councils are set to discuss their
OL,12,Fown lists in the coming days.
OL,14,FPSNI Supt Joanne Gibson said that
OL,15,Fpolice had warned councillors in
OL,16,FLisburn that publicising the data "may
OL,17,Flead to targeted activity against
OL,18,Foccupants".
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
